  "id": "wake-up-new-vilirth",
  "title": "Wake up, New Vilirth!",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "It’s a bright morning in our wonderful city. Forget your debt, your pain and your guilt. It’s time to wake up to a different world. After months away across the other side of the world, Rhea and her two colleagues return with a bounty that will fix everything. But someone has waited for them to return and instead of fixing their debt, they end up in worse conditions than before. They are offered a solution; to fix the problems of a wealthy man. It's tempting, a seemingly perfect and simple solution, but in the cutthroat political climate of New Vilirth, nothing is ever an easy fix.",
